=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# logs pager-commands ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# What each pager treatment would run, by the environment. Under$
# sudo and doas PAGER is dropped [I; not run for PAGER]. pager-$
# env runs as root whatever a kept PAGER names, and most has its$
# own shell escape [I]. LESSSECURE=1 is less(1)'s secure mode,$
# turning off ! and | and v [unverified: not run; BusyBox's less$
# unread]. The gallery's table: nothing runs.$
$
# pager-less, proposed -----------------------------------------$
$
   -  root login, PAGER=most$
      LESSSECURE=1 less /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  sudo, PAGER dropped$
      LESSSECURE=1 less /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  doas, PAGER dropped$
      LESSSECURE=1 less /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  sudo, PAGER=most kept$
      LESSSECURE=1 less /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  no less, no PAGER$
      None: the last lines alone$
$
# pager-env, P-18 as written -----------------------------------$
$
   -  root login, PAGER=most$
      most /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  sudo, PAGER dropped$
      LESSSECURE=1 less /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  doas, PAGER dropped$
      LESSSECURE=1 less /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  sudo, PAGER=most kept$
      most /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  no less, no PAGER$
      None: the last lines alone$
$
$

